  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>此版本仅适用于 1.20.4 - 1.21.1。本模组的新版 Neoforge 版本已<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-witch-huts\" rel=\"nofollow\">迁移至此</a>。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jDrTFGm.png\" alt=\"YUNG's Better Witch Huts\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"依赖 YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 Discord 上的 YUNG GANG！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上关注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"订阅我的 YouTube 频道！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fUg8dC9A.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2HNgRET.png\" alt=\"这是什么？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></a></p><p>女巫小屋的升级版！此模组新增了多种可生成的新小屋变体以及女巫的魔法圈。小屋现在拥有更好的设计和更有价值的战利品。酿造台可能包含暗示原版药水配方的物品！</p><p>默认情况下，原版女巫小屋将不再生成。您可以在配置中重新启用它们。<strong><br></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG's Better Witch Huts 旨在与所有世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Dungeons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-desert-temples-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Desert Temples</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用优惠码 YUNGNICKYOUNG 在 Bisect Hosting 享受 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
